BUILD-REPORT.md

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# Smoke test: toy-repo is provisioned at runtime, not committed
test/smoke/fixtures/toy-repo/
